name cascadia-code
category Package
revision 57478
shortdesc The Cascadia Code font with support for LaTeX and pdfLaTeX
longdesc Cascadia Code is a monospaced font by Microsoft. This package
longdesc provides the Cascadia Code family of fonts with support for
longdesc LaTeX and pdfLaTeX. Adding \usepackage{cascadia-code} to the
longdesc preamble of your document will activate Cascadia Code as the
longdesc typewriter font (\ttdefault).
execute addMap CascadiaCodThree.map
